@startuml Top_Level_Architecture_View_v3
' Top-level architecture view with explicit publish/subscribe event topics.
' Layout goal:
' - Discovery on the left
' - App on the right
' - Broker in the center
' - DiscoveryEvents above Broker
' - AppEvents below Broker
' - TCPManager below App, as a direct non-Broker path

skinparam componentStyle uml2

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam packageTitleFontSize 16
skinparam nodesep 90
skinparam ranksep 85
skinparam padding 12
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.2

hide stereotype

title LocalChat - Message Passing Architecture Overview

' --- Styles for non-component elements ---
skinparam rectangle<<router>> {
  BackgroundColor #EEF3FF
  BorderColor #2F5597
}

skinparam rectangle<<direct>> {
  BackgroundColor #F8F8F8
  BorderColor #555555
}

skinparam artifact<<data>> {
  BackgroundColor #FFF2CC
  BorderColor #7F6000
}

' --- Main components ---
component "Discovery" as Discovery
component "App" as App

' --- Event topics ---
interface "DiscoveryEvents" as DiscoveryEvents
interface "AppEvents" as AppEvents

' --- Non-component elements ---
rectangle "Broker\nmessage router" as Broker <<router>>
rectangle "TCPManager\nManages network traffic" as TCPManager <<direct>> #line.dashed
artifact "Service Data\nhostname\nregtype\ndomain\nport" as Service <<data>>

' --- Layout constraints ---
Discovery -[hidden]right- Broker
Broker -[hidden]right- App

DiscoveryEvents -[hidden]down- Broker
Broker -[hidden]down- AppEvents

Discovery -[hidden]down- Service
App -[hidden]down- TCPManager

' --- Broker owns/provides event topics ---
Broker -up- DiscoveryEvents
Broker -down- AppEvents

' --- DiscoveryEvents topic ---
Discovery -up-> DiscoveryEvents : publish
DiscoveryEvents <-- App : subscribe

' --- AppEvents topic ---
App -down-> AppEvents : publish
AppEvents <-- Discovery : subscribe

' --- Direct communication path, intentionally not via Broker ---
App <..> TCPManager

' --- Service registration data ---
Discovery <.. Service : Browses for service instances

note bottom of TCPManager
Messages not routed through broker:
direct communication.
end note

@enduml
